%% title: Consent Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING_SCA : consent created\n(TPP request received)
    PENDING_SCA --> ACTIVE : SCA challenge completed\n(CONSENT_GRANTED)
    PENDING_SCA --> REJECTED : SCA failed or\nTPP abandoned
    ACTIVE --> REVOKED : party or TPP revokes\n(CONSENT_REVOKED)
    ACTIVE --> EXPIRED : valid_to passed\n(max 90 days PSD2 RTS)
    REVOKED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
